WEBVTT

00:07:58.976 --> 00:08:00.746
And she loves to jump.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.150
(Dog barking)

00:08:02.174 --> 00:08:04.637
(Dog barking and spring boinging)

00:08:08.646 --> 00:08:11.281
And this is a new kind of zoetrope

00:08:11.305 --> 00:08:13.584
that I developed
at the Imaging Research Center

00:08:13.608 --> 00:08:15.128
at UMBC in Baltimore.

00:08:17.105 --> 00:08:19.328
And I call it a "real-time zoetrope."

00:08:19.352 --> 00:08:21.935
(Dog barking)

00:08:21.959 --> 00:08:24.325
(Dog barking and spring boinging)

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:26.881
Thank you.

00:08:26.905 --> 00:08:28.058
(Applause)